OL,3,GNEWSARAF Fairford suspects to be
OL,4,Areleased on bail, head of
OL,5,Acounter-terror police says
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive men arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fterror offences near RAF Fairford on
OL,9,FSunday are being released on bail, says
OL,10,Fthe head of UK counter terrorism
OL,11,Fpolicing
OL,13,FAssistant Commissioner Laurence Taylor
OL,14,Fsays the investigation is not over, and
OL,15,Fpolice are considering numerous angles,
OL,16,Fincluding whether proxies working on
OL,17,Fbehalf of a foreign state could have
OL,18,Fbeen involved
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
