OL,3,GNEWSARAF Fairford suspects to be
OL,4,Areleased on bail, head of
OL,5,Acounter-terror police says
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, Home Secretary Shabana
OL,8,FMahmood says that the scene is safe and
OL,9,Fresidents will soon be allowed to
OL,10,Freturn home
OL,12,FEarlier, a farmer who called 999 when
OL,13,Fshe saw "a large group of hooded and
OL,14,Fmasked men" said she "foiled" their
OL,15,Fplans. People living nearby say
OL,16,Fsecurity had been ramped up before the
OL,17,Farrests
OL,19,FThe RAF base is used by the US
OL,20,Fmilitary. President Trump said the US
OL,21,Fhad the five men "under view for a long
OL,22,Ftime, and we got them"
